    "rows": [
      {
        "shot": "01",
        "frame": 116,
        "caption": "十二个外观相同的球，恰有一个偏轻或偏重，其他十一个同重，也没有额外的正常球。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "01",
        "frame": 347,
        "caption": "只用等臂天平最多称三次，可以根据结果改下一称，要同时找出它的编号和轻重。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "02",
        "frame": 549,
        "caption": "每个球都可能偏重，也可能偏轻，所以要区分二十四种可能。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "02",
        "frame": 741,
        "caption": "每称只有左重、右重、平衡三种结果，第一称后只剩两称，每条分支就不能留下超过九种。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "03",
        "frame": 990,
        "caption": "先称一到四号，对五到八号：如果平衡，异常就在没上场的四个球里，还剩八种可能。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "03",
        "frame": 1219,
        "caption": "如果左重，只有左边四个偏重或右边四个偏轻；右重时反过来，也各剩八种。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "04",
        "frame": 1446,
        "caption": "这次实际是左重，所以只保留一到四号偏重、五到八号偏轻这八种。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "04",
        "frame": 1677,
        "caption": "九到十二号已经正常；接下来要让第二称的每个结果最多留下三种，最后一称才分得开。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "05",
        "frame": 1872,
        "caption": "先让四号重、七号轻、八号轻这三种留在盘外。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "05",
        "frame": 2036,
        "caption": "如果第二称平衡，就能保留这三种，其他五种要靠上场的位置分开。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "06",
        "frame": 2246,
        "caption": "把一号、二号放左边，三号放右边，它们若偏重，就让自己那边重。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "06",
        "frame": 2476,
        "caption": "偏轻却让对面重，所以把六号放右边、五号放左边，左右重两路便分别对应三种和两种。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "07",
        "frame": 2703,
        "caption": "右边还少一个球，就补上已经正常的九号，不会增加异常候选。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "07",
        "frame": 2922,
        "caption": "第二称因此是一、二、五号，对三、六、九号，三个结果分别留下三种、两种、三种。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "08",
        "frame": 3186,
        "caption": "实际第二称还是左重，只剩一号重、二号重、六号轻，最后称一号对二号。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "08",
