        "caption": "左重是一号重，右重是二号重，实际平衡，所以六号偏轻。",
        "diagramTextBottom": 813,
        "captionTop": 835,
        "minimumVerticalGap": 22,
        "captionLineCount": 1
      },
      {
        "shot": "09",
